OL,3,GNEWSAThird teen arrested after
OL,4,AHalloween party stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third teenage boy has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter five teenagers were stabbed at a
OL,8,FHalloween party.
OL,10,FPolice said they were called shortly
OL,11,Fafter 22:30 GMT on Saturday to Park
OL,12,FRoad in Chandler's Ford, Hampshire,
OL,13,Fwhere an "unknown group" had gained
OL,14,Fentry to the event.
OL,16,FOne 17-year-old boy remains in hospital
OL,17,Fin a life-threatening condition. The
OL,18,Fothers have been discharged from
OL,19,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
